":"Part of the Dexter cast in 2008. Julie Benz, David Zayas, Michael C. Hall and C. S. Lee","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADexterBenzZayasHallLee.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/John_Lithgow_8_by_David_Shankbone_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-John_Lithgow_8_by_David_Shankbone_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/John_Lithgow_8_by_David_Shankbone_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-John_Lithgow_8_by_David_Shankbone_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"John Lithgow played the antagonist in season 4","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJohn_Lithgow_8_by_David_Shankbone_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/500px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/1280px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/500px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Michael C. Hall in 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMichael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/David_Zayas.jpg/330px-David_Zayas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/David_Zayas.jpg/330px-David_Zayas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"When I first read the pilot of the show, I remember thinking it was really interesting, well written, and well structured. I didn’t know how people would receive it, but as an actor you don’t think too much about those things. You just see a good project and want to be involved in it, and that’s what Dexter was.\"—David Zayas[9]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADavid_Zayas.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG/500px-Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG/1280px-Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG/500px-Ocean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"View of Ocean Drive at night, a location heavily used in the series","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOcean_drive_south_beach_miami_night.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg/500px-Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg/1280px-Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg/500px-Michael_C._Hall_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Michael C. Hall received rave reviews for his portrayal of Dexter.[25][57][59][60]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMichael_C._Hall_2011.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Dexter, Minnesota Wind Turbines pic3","